alace of Masks, ~250 Chaac masks)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://worldhistoryedu.com/kabah-history-and-major-facts-of-this-maya-archaeological-site/ | Accessed 2026-07-06","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"private Puuc day-tour extension","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities","stay"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Sayil — Grand Palace (3-story, 100+ columns)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.machupicchu.org/ruta-puuc-2026-kabah-sayil-labna-uxmal-circuit.htm | Accessed 2026-07-06","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"Puuc day-tour extension","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities","stay"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Labná — Arch of Labná","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.machupicchu.org/ruta-puuc-2026-kabah-sayil-labna-uxmal-circuit.htm | Accessed 2026-07-06","si":"culture","commission":"Puuc day-tour extension","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — commission lane ''puuc day-tour extension''","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Xlapak","tier":"premier","source":"https://en-yucatan.com/ruta-puuc/ | Accessed 2026-07-06","si":"culture","commission":"completes premium private Ruta Puuc itinerary","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — default - a place to see or do (David 2026-10-05: fully integrated)","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Loltún caves (700m+ guided)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://yucatantoday.com/en/lolt-n-caves/ | Accessed 2026-07-06","hook":"Uneven, sometimes slick underground surfaces over a 700m+ route; entry is guided-only for safety","si":"expedition","blurb":"Uneven, sometimes slick underground surfaces over a 700m+ route; entry is guided-only for safety","commission":"GEA add-on (guiding/transport, Host); entrance non-commissionable","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"unparsed"},{"name":"Choco-Story México (Ecomuseo del Cacao)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://yucatantoday.com/en/blog/choco-story-uxmal-an-interactive-museum | Accessed 2026-07-06","si":"culinary","commission":"add-on ticket (affiliate/Viator) + lunch upsell","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["eat"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — food SI (David 2026-10-05: every traveler has to eat)","si_all":["culinary"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"primary","culture":"destination","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":["affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Hacienda Yaxcopoil","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.beyondtheordinary.co.uk/features/hacienda-yaxcopoil/ | Accessed 2026-07-06","hook":"19th-C henequen estate turned atmospheric museum, on Hwy 261 en route to Uxmal; visitable and event-capable","si":"culture","blurb":"19th-C henequen estate turned atmospheric museum, on Hwy 261 en route to Uxmal; visitable and event-capable","commission":"visit add-on; private-event via Host","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","culture":"primary","expedition":"destination"},"commission_lane":["event"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"Is Uxmal worth visiting instead of Chichén Itzá?","a":"Yes — it is the connoisseur''s Maya city. Uxmal is markedly less crowded than Chichén Itzá, with grander Puuc-style architecture: the rounded-corner Pyramid of the Magician, the lattice-stone Nunnery Quadrangle, and a Governor''s Palace whose five-acre platform carries an extended Chaac mosaic frieze. UNESCO inscribed it in 1996.","source":"mexicotravelandleisure.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"culture","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"Can you climb the pyramid at Uxmal?","a":"Partly — the distinction matters. Climbing El Adivino (the Pyramid of the Magician) is banned to protect it, but the Great Pyramid is climbable on its north side, on steep handrail-free Maya risers, so wear sturdy shoes and mind your footing. Do not assume the iconic rounded pyramid can be summited.","source":"yucatantoday.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"culture","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What is the Ruta Puuc, and are the Loltún caves worth it?","a":"The Ruta Puuc is the backroad ruin circuit south of Uxmal — Kabah (whose Codz Poop wears ~250 interlocking Chaac masks), Sayil''s three-story palace, the photogenic Arch of Labná, and quiet Xlapak. The Loltún caves cap it: a 700 m+ guided-only underground walk past cave paintings and \"musical\" ringing columns. A guided day neutralizes the heat, the remote road and the mandatory cave guide in one wrapper.","source":"yucatantoday.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for at Uxmal and on the Puuc route?","a":"Heat and remoteness, not crime. Uxmal''s plazas are fully exposed limestone with almost no shade, and the Ruta Puuc runs long stretches with no fuel, water or medical services between sites. Time the visit for early morning or late afternoon, carry 1.5–2 L of water per person plus a hat and SPF, and leave Muna with a full tank; the nearest hospital is Mérida, ~1h15 north.","source":"yucatantoday.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-06"}],"seo":{"jsonld_type":"TouristAttraction","meta_title":"Uxmal & the Ruta Puuc: UNESCO Maya City Guide (2026) | TravelWell.World","search_language":"en","local_keywords":["Uxmal Ruta Puuc","Pirámide del Adivino","espectáculo de luz y sonido Uxmal","Grutas de Loltún visita guiada","haciendas Ruta Puuc","Kabah Codz Poop"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"content_freshness":"2026-07-06","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","source_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}]},"long_tail":["Uxmal ruins guide 2026","Uxmal from Mérida day trip","Ruta Puuc Kabah Sayil Labná itinerary","Uxmal light and sound show tickets","Uxmal vs Chichén Itzá less crowded"]},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":["culture_heritage","expedition","culinary"],"ultra":[{"name":"Chablé Yucatán","tier":"ultra","earning_path":"Virtuoso / Fora","note":"#13 World''s Best Hotels 2023; 3,400+ tequila bottles; ~30 min Mérida","source":"https://www.virtuoso.com/travel/luxury-hotels/15452675/chable-yucatan | Accessed 2026-07-06"},{"name":"Hacienda Temozón (Luxury Collection)","tier":"ultra","earning_path":"Virtuoso / Marriott STARS / Fora / MoR","note":"28 rooms; ~35 min Uxmal — natural Puuc base","source":"https://www.travelweekly.com/Hotels/Abala-Mexico/Hacienda-Temozon-Luxury-Collection-p51093491 | Accessed 2026-07-06"},{"name":"Hacienda Santa Rosa (Luxury Collection)","tier":"ultra","earning_path":"Virtuoso / Marriott STARS / MoR","note":"intimate 11 rooms","source":"https://www.letstraveltomexico.com/yucatan-haciendas/ | Accessed 2026-07-06"},{"name":"The Lodge at Uxmal","tier":"premier","earning_path":"Host FIT / MoR","note":"on-gate, walk to ruins"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-06","hero":{"query":"Uxmal, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":20.3597,"lng":-89.7714},"orbit":[{"id":"celestun-mexico","jewels":6,"si":["expedition","tropical"]},{"id":"chichen-itza-mexico","jewels":7,"si":["culture","expedition","wellness"]},{"id":"izamal-mexico","jewels":8,"si":["culture","romance","culinary"]},{"id":"merida-mexico","jewels":15,"si":["romance","expedition","culture","culinary"]},{"id":"rio-lagartos-mexico","jewels":6,"si":["expedition","tropical"]},{"id":"valladolid-mexico","jewels":9,"si":["expedition","culture","culinary"]}],"orbit_country":["akumal-mexico","bacalar-mexico","balandra-beach-mexico","cabo-pulmo-mexico","cabo-san-lucas-mexico","calakmul-mexico","campeche-city-mexico","cancun-mexico","careyes-mexico","chapala-ajijic-mexico","coba-mexico","costalegre-mexico","cozumel-mexico","east-cape-mexico","ensenada-mexico","espiritu-santo-island-mexico","guadalajara-mexico","guanajuato-city-mexico","holbox-mexico","huatulco-mexico","isla-contoy-mexico","isla-mujeres-mexico","la-paz-mexico","loreto-mexico","los-barriles-mexico","magdalena-bay-mexico","mahahual-mexico","mazamitla-mexico","mexico-city-mexico","oaxaca-city-mexico","palenque-mexico","playa-del-carmen-mexico","puerto-aventuras-mexico","puerto-morelos-mexico","puerto-vallarta-mexico","punta-mita-mexico","san-cristobal-de-las-casas-mexico","san-jose-del-cabo-mexico","san-miguel-de-allende-mexico","san-sebastian-d