e trip) - activity affiliate where listed","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (CC review) - reached by boat or water - sold as a boat, snorkel or dive trip by local operators"},{"name":"Thunderball Grotto","blurb":"\"Located just west of Staniel Cay, this fantastic underwater cave system is great for snorkeling, diving, and wading.\" \"It is advised to enter at ebb tide (low or slack tide) and snorkeling equipment is optional. At high tide, however, diving equipment is necessary.\"","si":["diveglobal","tropical","adventure","ocean"],"wells":["activities","gear"],"draw_rank":2,"fit_rules":{"duration":"1-2h (within full-day)","before":"swim ability","after":"none (snorkel = no restriction)","pairs_with":"pigs + Staniel Cay lunch","time_season":"enter at ebb tide (low or slack tide) - bahamas.com; at high tide diving equipment is necessary"},"tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/experiences/thunderball-grotto","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","commission":"operator (boat, snorkel or dive trip) - activity affiliate where listed","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (CC review) - reached by boat or water - sold as a boat, snorkel or dive trip by local operators"},{"name":"Exuma Cays Land & Sea Park","blurb":"Bahamas National Trust: \"the first marine reserve in The Bahamas and the wider Caribbean\"; \"no fishing, shelling, conching of any kind is permited within Exuma Park boundries\" [sic]; wardens and RBDF officers stationed at Warderick Wells; moorings throughout; VHF Channel 09; 2018 Platinum Global Ocean Refuge Award","si":["diveglobal","wildlife","sailing","yacht","hiking"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities","stay"],"draw_rank":3,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://bnt.bs/explore/exuma/exuma-cays-land-sea-park/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Exuma Water Sports - Full Day Staniel Cay Swimming Pigs Tour","blurb":"Swimming pigs at Big Major''s Cay, \"endangered Bahamian Rock Iguanas on Leaf Cay\", nurse sharks at Compass Cay and \"Snorkeling in Thunderball Grotto (Advanced Snorkeling)\"; pickups across Great Exuma; adults from $435, teens $385, children $350, \"covers lunch and landing fees\"; +1 242 357 0555","si":["wildlife","family","tropical","adventure","ocean"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities","eat","move"],"draw_rank":4,"fit_rules":{"duration":"full-day (operator page: 8 hours)","before":"none","after":"none","pairs_with":"Thunderball snorkel + iguanas","time_season":"year-round, calm-sea AM best (open water)"},"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://exumawatersports.com/tours/full-day-007-staniel-cay-swimming-pigs-tour/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Fowl Cay Resort","blurb":"All-inclusive private island near Staniel Cay: six oceanfront villas for 2-6 guests, each with a \"personal powerboat with unlimited fuel\", \"all meals and drinks (incl. premium alcohol)\", tennis and a freshwater pool; Unique Travel Corp. is worldwide representative; 1-877-845-5275","si":["romance","tropical","yacht","family"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["stay","eat","move"],"draw_rank":5,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.fowlcay.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Staniel Cay Yacht Club","blurb":"\"a hidden gem in the Exuma Cays of the Bahamas\" - bungalows, villas and suites with a marina, restaurant and pool; promotes the swimming pigs and Thunderball Grotto; Makers Air and Charter Flights Florida linked for flights; info@stanielcay.com, (954) 467-6658","si":["yacht","tropical","wildlife","romance","sailing"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["stay","eat"],"draw_rank":6,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.stanielcay.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Chat ''N'' Chill, Stocking Island"