-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Compass Cay Marina and its nurse sharks","blurb":"\"Compass Cay''s protected marina is an unmissable stop in your island hopping itinerary. Hang out at the dock and enjoy a cold beer, or hop into the water and share a moment with the gentle nurse sharks that live here.\"","si":["wildlife","yacht","sailing","ocean"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities","eat"],"draw_rank":10,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/the-exumas","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Stocking Island","blurb":"\"Located off the port of Georgetown, Great Exuma, highlights of Stocking Island includes blue holes, coral gardens, and undersea caves\"; stromatolites on Atlantic-side beaches; \"easily reachable by boat from Elizabeth Harbour\"; Exuma Tourist Office (242) 336-2430","si":["tropical","diveglobal","family","hiking"],"wells":["activities","move"],"draw_rank":11,"tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/experiences/stocking-island","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","commission":"operator (boat, snorkel or dive trip) - activity affiliate where listed","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (CC review) - reached by boat or water - sold as a boat, snorkel or dive trip by local operators"},{"name":"Tropic of Cancer Beach, Little Exuma","blurb":"\"This crescent of powder-white sand and translucent blue-green water gets its name from its geographic location on the Tropic of Cancer.\" \"Smaller and quieter than its counterpart, Little Exuma is home to the Tropic of Cancer beach.\"","si":["tropical","romance","family","senior"],"wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":12,"tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/the-exumas","accessed":"2026-10-02","commission":"entry non-commissionable (curated) - pair with a beach stay or boat day","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (